# Savoria — Restaurant Website

A responsive restaurant website built as a **personal portfolio project** by Muhammad Saqib.

## ✨ Features

- Responsive desktop and mobile layout
- Modern restaurant landing page
- About/story section
- Menu cards
- Gallery section
- Reservation request form with client-side feedback
- Contact section
- Mobile navigation
- Semantic HTML and accessible form controls
- Clean CSS architecture

## 🧰 Technologies

- HTML5
- CSS3
- Vanilla JavaScript
- Google Fonts
- Unsplash image URLs for demo imagery

## 🚀 Run Locally

1. Clone or download the repository.
2. Open `index.html` in a browser.

No build tools or dependencies are required.

## 📁 Project Structure

```text
restaurant-website/
├── index.html
├── style.css
├── script.js
└── README.md
```

## 🎯 Purpose

This is a fictional restaurant concept created to demonstrate responsive web design, frontend development, UI structure, and JavaScript interaction.

It is not presented as paid client work.

